      "text": "are now fewer than a dozen. Each one that closes takes with it a set of",
      "indent": 12,
      "y": 624,
      "pageNum": 1,
      "fonts": [
        {
          "bucket": "mono",
          "size": 12,
          "chars": 66
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "recommendations that existed nowhere else, held by a person who never",
      "indent": 12,
      "y": 612,
      "pageNum": 1,
      "fonts": [
        {
          "bucket": "mono",
          "size": 12,
          "chars": 68
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "wrote any of it down.",
      "indent": 12,
      "y": 600,
      "pageNum": 1,
      "fonts": [
        {
          "bucket": "mono",
          "size": 12,
          "chars": 20
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "We propose to film the last year of one of them.",
      "indent": 12,
      "y": 576,
      "pageNum": 1,
      "fonts": [
        {
          "bucket": "mono",
          "size": 12,
          "chars": 47
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "AUDIENCE",
      "indent": 12,
      "y": 552,
      "pageNum": 1,
      "fonts": [
        {
          "bucket": "mono",
          "size": 12,
          "chars": 8
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The film is for the generation that grew up inside these rooms and for",
      "indent": 12,
      "y": 528,
      "pageNum": 1,
      "fonts": [
        {
          "bucket": "mono",
          "size": 12,
          "chars": 67
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "the one that has only ever been handed an algorithm. It argues, gently,",
      "indent": 12,
      "y": 516,
      "pageNum": 1,
      "fonts": [
        {
          "bucket": "mono",
          "size": 12,
          "chars": 68
        }
      ]
    },
