      "indent": 12,
      "y": 504,
      "pageNum": 1,
      "fonts": [
        {
          "bucket": "mono",
          "size": 12,
          "chars": 47
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "BUDGET",
      "indent": 12,
      "y": 480,
      "pageNum": 1,
      "fonts": [
        {
          "bucket": "mono",
          "size": 12,
          "chars": 6
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A crew of four, ninety shooting days, and the patience to wait for a",
      "indent": 12,
      "y": 456,
      "pageNum": 1,
      "fonts": [
        {
          "bucket": "mono",
          "size": 12,
          "chars": 64
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Tuesday when nothing happens. The full schedule follows overleaf, along",
      "indent": 12,
